{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6160","title":"Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo Makes Asia Debut with Full EV Lineup and \"Human x Car x Home\" Ecosystem at 2026 Beijing Auto Show","desc":"26,000 SU7 deliveries in 35 days, Xiaomi YU7 GT launching late May, and a first look at the Germany-based R\u0026D team driving global expansion","view_cnt":"2460","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1777032030","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/695_operatorx_operatorx_opx/24/04/2026/1b345a12c6423ab4a0787f44422e6a64.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, April 24th, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;- Global technology leader Xiaomi today makes the Asia debut of its Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo concept hypercar at the 2026 Beijing International Automotive Exhibition (Auto China 2026). The company also showcases its full production vehicle lineup, including the new-generation Xiaomi SU7, Xiaomi YU7, and Xiaomi SU7 Ultra.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/186_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/25/04/2026/c715d909f8a3bb8b0c6e961fdd348fa9.jpg\" alt=\"At the launch event, a speaker stands in front of a black car cover, with a screen in the background showcasing the new Xiaomi car, displaying the words \u0026quot;2026 Beijing International Auto Show Launch Event.\u0026quot;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn day one of the Auto China 2026, Xiaomi revealed the sales performance of the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 and shared its launch plans for Xiaomi YU7 GT. Meanwhile, Xiaomi offered a first introduction to the expert team of its Europe R\u0026amp;D Center in Germany, a highly experienced, industry-renowned R\u0026amp;D and design team team from around the world.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi has demonstrated its steady progress and continuous breakthroughs in design, engineering, and smart technology, redefining what users can expect from its EVs while signaling its long-term commitment to accelerating global expansion with a fresh EV identity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNew-Generation\u0026nbsp;Xiaomi\u0026nbsp;SU7 Rapidly Delivers at Scale as the “New Driver‘s Car”\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn just two years, Xiaomi Auto has achieved accumulative deliveries of over 650,000 vehicles, with both Xiaomi SU7 and Xiaomi YU7 becoming bestsellers in the market. Since its launch on March 19, 2026, the New-generation Xiaomi SU7 has deliveries surpassing 26,000 units within 35 days of its first delivery.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe New-generation Xiaomi SU7 offers comprehensive upgrades in safety, handling, intelligence, and premium quality, and is committed to being the dream car that carries every aspiration. During a recent livestream challenge, Lei Jun— Founder, Chairman, and CEO of Xiaomi Group — drove the New-generation Xiaomi SU7 Pro for 1,313 kilometers from Beijing to Shanghai with just one recharging stop, demonstrating its outstanding range performance and top-tier energy efficiency.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePositioned as a premium high-performance SUV, Xiaomi YU7 has also achieved impressive market results. In just ten months since its launch, it has delivered over 230,000 units. Building on this momentum, Xiaomi YU7 GT is set to launch in China in late May this year, delivering a brand-new experience that blends performance, luxury, and driving pleasure.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Introduces Its\u0026nbsp;New\u0026nbsp;Europe R\u0026amp;D and Design Center Team for the First Time in China\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo deliver an even more premium, higher-quality driving and intelligent mobility experience, Xiaomi officially established its Xiaomi Auto Europe R\u0026amp;D Center in Munich, Germany, in September 2025. The center assembles world-leading experts and experienced automotive designers. Leveraging the team‘s deep R\u0026amp;D expertise and global innovation perspective, it continues to refine Xiaomi Auto’s high-performance DNA, premium craftsmanship, and innovative core, underscoring the company‘s strong engineering capabilities and its forward-looking global vision.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/398_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/25/04/2026/0c1d215ef81c7687e1d9d96e6f86ad71.jpg\" alt=\"A speaker is addressing the audience on stage, with a photo of the Xiaomi Automobile European R\u0026amp;D Center team in the background, and a car covered with a black cloth in front.\"\u003eBy leveraging world-class competences and ecosystem, Xiaomi Auto accelerates breakthroughs in intelligent driving and vehicle dynamics. This expansion of the R\u0026amp;D network strengthens the company's ability to deliver vehicles that truly inspire and are renowned for their performance, whilst ensuring Xiaomi Auto’s products align with global standards of safety, and quality.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis center also marks a significant step forward in Xiaomi's global strategy and automotive innovation, while representing major progress in its long-term \"Human x Car x Home\" smart ecosystem strategy and paving the way for Xiaomi Auto‘s entry into the European market in 2027.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Vision Gran Turismo Concept Makes China Debut, Imagining the Future of Mobility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEarlier this year at MWC Barcelona 2026, Xiaomi unveiled its first Vision Gran Turismo concept vehicle, the Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo. Now, Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo makes its Asia debut at Auto China 2026, marking its first official appearance on home soil.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Vision Gran Turismo is Xiaomi's forward-looking design exploration project in the virtual world, pushing boundaries in aerodynamics while expressing the deepest thinking on electrification and intelligent mobility. Approaching hypercar design from a technology company's perspective, Xiaomi reimagines the logic of performance vehicles, exploring the limitless possibilities of future mobility and the driving experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is not only the first Chinese brand to receive an invitation, also the first technology company ever to join, marking a historic breakthrough for Chinese automotive design on the global stage.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/182_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/25/04/2026/d4d278a8f1ff1f5f748a3e5647a00523.jpg\" alt=\"A futuristic designed sports car is showcased, with doors opening upwards. The background features a simple gradient color, and the top displays the words \u0026quot;xiaomi | GT.\u0026quot; The car body is streamlined, equipped with large tires, presenting a sense of technology and dynamism overall.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA Driver's Car That Masters Both Lightness and Aerodynamic Efficiency\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor an electric hypercar, balancing low drag with high downforce is paramount. Conventional hypercars rely on bolt-on elements like large rear wings to generate downforce, adding weight and compromising efficiency. Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo takes a fundamentally different approach, drawing from aviation's inverse lift-body design. By inverting the integrated wing-fuselage concept used in advanced aircraft, the car generates massive downforce purely through accelerated airflow across its underbody with no additional components required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe higher the aerodynamic efficiency ratio, the more downforce gained per unit of drag added. Simulation testing confirms Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo achieves an aerodynamic efficiency rating of 4.1, a downforce coefficient of 1.2, and a drag coefficient of 0.29 — meaning every 1 unit of drag yields 4.1 units of downforce. This surpasses most top-tier hypercars on the market today, delivering a perfect synthesis of lightness and aerodynamic performance that defines its identity as the ultimate driver’s car of the future.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/806_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/25/04/2026/ee56cacced8bb04bf8416f3f6382e314.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntelligent Human-Car Symbiosis, Reimagined for the Hypercar\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Vision Gran Turismo integrates next-generation smart interaction into the hypercar cockpit. Equipped with multi-modal sensors, the car continuously monitors the driver's biometric state. At high speed, real-time heart rate is displayed directly on the steering wheel, enabling the car to sense driver condition and help maintain optimal vehicle control. This delivers a true \"human-car unity\" experience, breaking the long-standing tradeoff between raw performance and intelligent capability that has defined traditional hypercars.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Xiaomi Aesthetic\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e,\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;a Fully Minimalist, Natural Design\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Vision GT was conceived as a unified whole from the very first sketch. Aerodynamics and form were never treated as separate disciplines — every surface shaped to meet aerodynamic goals without a single bolt-on addition. The silhouette flows like a suspended water droplet, seamlessly whole. This embodies Xiaomi’s design philosophy of Intuitive Beauty, Natural Beauty, while integrating signature family design elements — the halo-shaped taillights and cross-shaped headlights — for an unmistakable visual identity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eVisitors to the 2026 Beijing Auto Show can experience the Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo, along with Xiaomi's full EV lineup and its \"Human x Car x Home\" smart ecosystem, at the Xiaomi booth — Hall A4, Booth A402, at the Capital International Convention and Exhibition Center (CIECC).\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones, smart hardware, and smart electric vehicles connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience, and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In December 2025, the MAU reached 754.1 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform. As of December 31, 2025, the number of IoT devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops, and tablets) reached 1,079.2 million. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merging personal devices, smart home products, and cars. The Company has rapidly emerged as a leading innovator in the smart electric vehicle industry, reaching profitability within six quarters of commencing deliveries and delivering over 600,000 units by February 2026. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better-connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2025, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the seventh year in a row, ranking 297th.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index, and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"1111","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1777031955"},"common":null}